      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Beenleigh railway line opened in 1885, and Runcorn railway station began servicing the area the same year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Runcorn%2C_Queensland",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1886, Messrs Main, Clazy and Smith started the Runcorn Bone Mill, whose fertilizer reached farmers as far as New Zealand.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
